	"Name": "(CP) MoreMoss Chopping",
	"Author": "Safty112",
	"Description": "I couldn't find a mod that added moss as a tree drop so I made a basic Content Patcher mod to add it as a drop.\u00A0You will need the latest version (2.8.1) of Content Patcher for this mod to work.\n<br />\n<br />Specifically\u00A0this mod adds moss as an item drop for all types of trees. By default all trees have a 10% chance to drop moss. You can change this in the GMCM config or in the config file.\n<br />\n<br />Update 1.1 now supports [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098?tab=description]Generic\u00A0Mod Config Menu (GMCM)[/url]. For simplicity options are provided for 1%, and 10% and then increasing by 10% until 100%. You can reference [url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Wild_trees]the wiki[/url] on how to adjust some of the values in the content.json if you want any values not provided.\n<br />\n<br />This mod works well with my other mod [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/39632]MoreMoss Monsters[/url], which adds moss as a monster drop.",
